# `backlog board export` writes its markdown to Backlog.md by default, which is
# the same name Backlog uses for its own config file. The real config here is
# backlog/config.yml, so nothing breaks, but the export is a throwaway artifact
# that must never be committed - export to a path under backlog/ instead.
/Backlog.md
